  "summary": "Astrology guidance for Cancer on July 27, 2026: face fear and choose growth. After a period of slowing down, you have a new perspective to learn and evolve from. Several paths lie ahead; be decisive, nurture yourself and make bold moves that align with your goals.",
  "content": "Face fear and rise,Cancer. This is your theme this week. The past couple of years may have felt as though they were tearing you down, especially the past couple of months, and you chose to slow down and try a new approach\u2014which may or may not have worked. But it gave you time to breathe, offered you a different perspective and helped you realise the things you need to learn, change, evolve through and grow from. There are several paths laid out in front of you and you must choose which way you wish to go. This is not a time to remain passive. This is the time to choose growth.\n\nCosmic tip:Nurture yourself but also make bold decisions that move you in your desired direction.\n\nAries July 27, 2026\n\nTaurus July 27, 2026\n\nGemini July 27, 2026\n\nLeo July 27, 2026\n\nLibra July 27, 2026\n\nScorpio July 27, 2026\n\nVirgo July 27, 2026\n\nSagittarius July 27, 2026\n\nCapricorn July 27, 2026\n\nAquarius July 27, 2026\n\nPisces July 27, 2026\n\nSee more stories\n\nCond\u00e9 Nast India\n\n\u00a9 2026 Cond\u00e9 Nast. All rights reserved. Use of this website constitutes acceptance of ourTerms of ServiceandPolicy and Cookie Statement. The material on this site may not be reproduced, distributed, transmitted, cached or otherwise used, except with the prior written permission of Cond\u00e9 Nast.",
